    "n_cells_in_sweep": 35,
    "explanation": "kill depends on C only through C/kill_C50 and the effective MIC is proportional to kill_C50; with linear PK the re-solved dose scales by the same factor, so every MIC level reproduces one trajectory. Residual spread is the tolerance of the effective-MIC root (the dose is solved to 1e-6 mg from the PK alone)."
  },
